site. If you have questions send an e-mail. They are pretty helpful. 

4) I have had excellent luck with older lsilogic cards, and srm works
with them. Qlogic cards should work also.

5) Don't know about raid lsilogic or qlogic cards. 

6) Try Linux 2.6.6 works like a charm with alpha. 

7) Don't know about scsi raid cards. I use the raid that is in linux
kernel. 

8) I dropped scsi and use an ide raid setup using silicon image 610
ide controller, but can't boot from this setup so I have to use cd
boot, net boot, scsi drive boot, or floppy boot. The highpoint ide
sata also works search this group for details.

